                            Major Georges Bart.
                            Kazan Military Academy
                            24th December

Dear &

I periodically asked headquarters for news about you.
I insist on personally congratulating you on the victories
you have achieved. Here at the Academy everybody's talking
about your achievements, you have become the hero of our
young recruits, as for the elders, all claim to have been
of your friends during your stay among us.

I Know you have the calibre of a real chief, and that the
tyrannic Colonel Rorscham will not be able to foil you in
your career. Therefore I would like to help you if you
request another posting. Let me tell you that I personally
know the General Konrad Tyron that supervises all the
operations in your sector, and it will only take a word
for your application to be accepted.
He certainly owes me that...

You will in this way have the liberty to choose missions more
or less difficult, but each representing a new challenge.
I don't doubt that this kind of CUSTOM GAME will delight you.

Take care of yourself and good luck.